    "overview": "Experience crystal-clear surveillance with the Intex 5MP Outdoor Security Camera, designed for both home and business safety. Featuring a 1/3\" 5.0 Megapixel CMOS sensor and a 3.6mm lens, it delivers exceptional 2592x1920 resolution for sharper details. With a minimum illumination of 0.01Lux/F1.2 (IR ON), the camera captures bright and clear images even in low-light conditions. Equipped with 12 high-power IR LEDs (14 mil), it provides up to 20 meters of night vision range, ensuring 24x7 protection. The 2D noise reduction and anti-fog function enhance image clarity, while lightning protection safeguards against harsh weather. Its plastic body with multiple angle adjustment makes installation flexible and durable for long-term outdoor use.",
